  "description": "The native payload for Agora's 3D spatial audio extension (spatial-audio 4.6.3 on Maven Central), packaged for .NET for Android. Places each remote speaker somewhere around the listener's head, so a call or a game world has direction and distance rather than one flat mix. Add it alongside Net.Agora.Video.Android or Net.Agora.Voice.Android — it carries no managed API of its own; the switch that turns it on is RtcEngine.GetLocalSpatialAudioEngine in the RTC binding.",
